      "message": "fix(pathkernel): one retract check for an exit, and a named lead-out fallback\n\nExit::new and Exit::proved share check_retract. An exit with no lead-out where the arc does not fit carries a Fallback (arc lead-out -> straight retract, NO_LEAD_OUT_ROOM / NO_END_DIRECTION).\n\nRefs #4407\nRefs #4383\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
