      },
      "message": "fix(motion): the converter refuses a low retract and names an empty arc\n\nAn exit under the clearance height is refused (EXIT_UNDER_CLEARANCE), not raised in silence. An exit fallback goes to the notes. An empty arc output is ARC_EMPTY, not ARC_NOT_MONOTONE.\n\nRefs #4407\nRefs #4383\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
